#: ../../tools/semantic_scholar_ext_tools.rst:100
#: 44e46d3c444144d3b69d57a5b1f04096
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get paper recommendations from Semantic Scholar for a "
"given paper. Returns papers similar to or related to the input paper "
"based on Semantic Scholar's recommendation algorithm. Useful for "
"literature discovery - finding related work that you might have missed. "
"Requires a Semantic Scholar paper ID (40-char hex). Use "
"SemanticScholar\\_get\\_paper with DOI: prefix first to get the paper ID "
"if you only have a DOI."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/semantic_scholar_ext_tools.rst:104
#: 275c81a14c00472880c698c179ec368f
msgid ""
"``paper_id`` (string) (required) Semantic Scholar paper ID (40-char hex, "
"e.g., '68d962effe5520777791bd6ec8ffa4b963ba4f38'). Get this from "
"SemanticScholar\\_get\\_paper or SemanticScholar\\_search\\_papers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/semantic_scholar_ext_tools.rst:107
#: 09a3d46719cf43aaa93e4afe007d5bac
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Number of recommendations to return "
"(default 10, max 500)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/semantic_scholar_ext_tools.rst:110
#: 77c88c3cc9124d67b7f4160a3c121ce4
msgid ""
"``fields`` (string) (optional) Comma-separated fields for recommended "
"papers: title,year,citationCount,abstract,authors,externalIds"
msgstr ""

